    "stem": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The distribution of the large blue butterfly, <i>Phengaris</i> <i>arion</i>, extends across Europe and Asia. It is assessed by the International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN) on the Red List™ as ‘Near Threatened’ globally and ‘Endangered’ in Europe.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In Europe, <i>P.</i> <i>arion</i> became extinct in the Netherlands in 1964 and in the United Kingdom in 1979.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fig. 6.1 lists the conservation status categories in the IUCN Red List™.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "figure",
        "id": "fig6.1",
        "caption": "Fig. 6.1",
        "src": "figures/q6_fig6_1.png",
        "alt": "IUCN Red List categories",
        "source": {
          "qp": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fig. 6.2 shows <i>P.</i> <i>arion</i>.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "figure",
        "id": "fig6.2",
