        "stem": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<i>P.</i> <i>arion</i> has been successfully re‑introduced in the United Kingdom at 12 sites. These sites were restored to flower‑rich grassland.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 15
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The conservation management actions designed for <i>P.</i> <i>arion</i> also resulted in the re‑establishment or increase of other species at the restored sites. These included 12 species of flowering plant, 8 other butterfly species and 4 species of other insects.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 15
            }
          }
        ],
